    "title": "Complete VEO 3 TikTok Automation App",
    "prompt": "Please create a complete app that follows the structure of this n8n workflow. Copy 1 on 1 and make sure everything works immediately. Use Lovable AI for LLMs.\n\n## App Overview\nBuild an automated AI video content pipeline with these features:\n\n### 1. Dashboard\n- Overview of generated videos with status (pending, generating, done, published)\n- Stats: total videos, published today, pending generation\n- Manual trigger button to generate new content\n\n### 2. Idea Generation (Lovable AI - google/gemini-2.5-flash)\nGenerate creative BEFORE/AFTER transformation concepts with structured output:\n- Caption: viral-friendly with emoji and 12 hashtags\n- Idea: max 15 words describing the transformation\n- Environment: max 20 words describing setting, lighting, style\n- Sound: max 15 words describing audio design\n- Status: \"for production\"\n\nSystem prompt for idea generation:\n```\nYou are an AI designed to generate one original BEFORE/AFTER transformation video concept optimized for TikTok and VEO 3. Return a single JSON object with Caption, Idea, Environment, Sound, and Status fields. Focus on non-human subjects, cinematic visuals, and novelty.\n```\n\n### 3. Video Script Generation (Lovable AI - google/gemini-2.5-flash)\nTransform ideas into structured VEO 3 prompts with:\n- title: short descriptive title (max 15 words)\n- final_prompt: JSON string with description, style, camera, lighting, environment, elements, subject, motion, VFX, audio, ending, format, keywords\n\n### 4. VEO 3 Integration (Kie API)\nEdge function to generate videos:\n```typescript\n// POST https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/veo/generate\nconst response = await fetch(\"https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/veo/generate\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"Authorization\": `Bearer ${KIE_API_KEY}`\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({\n    prompt: finalPrompt,\n    model: \"veo3_fast\",\n    aspectRatio: \"9:16\"\n  })\n});\n// Returns { data: { taskId: \"...\" } }\n\n// Poll for completion: GET https://api.kie.ai/api/v1/veo/record-info?taskId=...\n// Returns { data: { response: { resultUrls: [\"video_url\"] } } }\n```\n\n### 5. Blotato Integration (TikTok Upload)\nEdge function for TikTok publishing:\n```typescript\n// Step 1: Upload media\nconst mediaResponse = await fetch(\"https://backend.blotato.com/v2/media\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"blotato-api-key\": BLOTATO_API_KEY\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({ url: videoUrl })\n});\n// Returns { id: \"media-uuid\", url: \"blotato-hosted-url\" }\n\n// Step 2: Create TikTok post\nconst postResponse = await fetch(\"https://backend.blotato.com/v2/posts\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"blotato-api-key\": BLOTATO_API_KEY\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({\n    post: {\n      accountId: TIKTOK_ACCOUNT_ID,\n      target: {\n        targetType: \"tiktok\",\n        privacyLevel: \"PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE\",\n        disabledComments: false,\n        disabledDuet: false,\n        disabledStitch: false,\n        isBrandedContent: false,\n        isYourBrand: false,\n        isAiGenerated: true\n      },\n      content: {\n        platform: \"tiktok\",\n        text: caption,\n        mediaUrls: [blotatoMediaUrl]\n      },\n      options: { isAiGenerated: true }\n    }\n  })\n});\n```\n\n### 6. Database Schema\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE video_ideas (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  caption TEXT NOT NULL,\n  idea TEXT NOT NULL,\n  environment_prompt TEXT NOT NULL,\n  sound_prompt TEXT NOT NULL,\n  status TEXT DEFAULT 'for_production',\n  final_prompt JSONB,\n  video_url TEXT,\n  blotato_media_url TEXT,\n  tiktok_post_id TEXT,\n  production_status TEXT DEFAULT 'pending', -- pending, generating, done, published\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()\n);\n```\n\n### 7. UI Components\n- Ideas list with filters by status\n- Video preview player for completed videos\n- Generate button with loading state\n- Settings page for API keys (Kie, Blotato, TikTok Account ID)\n- Real-time status updates during generation\n\n### 8. Automation Flow\n1. User clicks \"Generate New Video\" or scheduled trigger fires\n2. AI generates creative idea \u2192 saves to database\n3. AI generates structured VEO 3 prompt \u2192 updates database\n4. Call Kie API to start video generation \u2192 poll for completion\n5. Upload completed video to Blotato \u2192 get hosted URL\n6. Post to TikTok with caption and hashtags\n7. Update status to \"published\"\n\nUse 2027 dark glassmorphism design with Neo Lime accents.",
    "context": "This prompt creates a complete automated content pipeline replicating an n8n workflow. It uses Lovable AI (Gemini) for idea generation and script writing, Kie API for VEO 3 video generation, and Blotato for TikTok publishing. The app handles the full lifecycle from creative ideation to social media publication.",
    "note": "Required secrets: KIE_API_KEY, BLOTATO_API_KEY, TIKTOK_ACCOUNT_ID. The VEO 3 generation is async - implement polling every 30 seconds for up to 5 minutes. Use Lovable AI models (google/gemini-2.5-flash) instead of OpenAI to avoid requiring additional API keys.",
    "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:10:44.703304+00:00"
